\q1 \v 10 \w If you faint|strong="H07503"\w* \w in the day|strong="H03117"\w* \w of distress|strong="H06869"\w*,
\q2 \w how small|strong="H06862"\w* \w is your strength|strong="H03581"\w*!
\q1 \v 11 \w Rescue|strong="H05337"\w* \w those being led away|strong="H03947"\w* \w to death|strong="H04194"\w*,
\q2 \w and restrain|strong="H02820"\w* \w those stumbling|strong="H04131"\w* \w toward the slaughter|strong="H02027"\w*.
