\q2 \w and do not|strong="H00408"\w* \w stand|strong="H05975"\w* \w in the place|strong="H04725"\w* \w of great men|strong="H01419"\w*;
\q1 \v 7 \w for|strong="H03588"\w* \w it is better|strong="H02896"\w* \w to be told|strong="H00559"\w*, “\w Come up|strong="H05927"\w* \w here|strong="H02008"\w*!”
\q2 \w than to be demoted|strong="H08213"\w* \w in the presence|strong="H06440"\w* \w of the prince|strong="H05081"\w*.
\b 
\q1 \w Even what|strong="H00834"\w*\f + \fr 25:7 \ft Or \fqa Even the one\f* \w you have seen|strong="H07200"\w* \w with your own eyes|strong="H05869"\w*,
