\q2 \w when your neighbor|strong="H07453"\w* \w puts you to shame|strong="H03637"\w*?
\b 
\q1 \v 9 \w Argue|strong="H07379"\w* \w your case|strong="H07378"\w* \w with|strong="H00854"\w* \w your neighbor|strong="H07453"\w*
\q2 \w without|strong="H00408"\w* \w betraying|strong="H01540"\w* \w another’s|strong="H00312"\w* \w confidence|strong="H05475"\w*,
