\c 27
\s1 Do Not Boast about Tomorrow
\r (James 4:13–17)
\q1 \v 1 \w Do not|strong="H00408"\w* \w boast|strong="H01984"\w* \w about tomorrow|strong="H03117"\w*,
\q2 \w for|strong="H03588"\w* \w you do not|strong="H03808"\w* \w know|strong="H03045"\w* \w what|strong="H04100"\w* \w a day|strong="H03117"\w* \w may bring|strong="H03205"\w*.
